3	3	3	3
explain format=tree select * from t2 where a = 3;
EXPLAIN
-> Gather Receiver (slice: 0; workers: 1)
    -> Gather Sender (slice: 1; workers: 1)
        -> Filter: (t2.a = 3)  (cost=0.75 rows=1)
            -> Parallel table scan on t2, with parallel partitions: 1  (cost=0.75 rows=5)

